'''Hot, Fresh 'n' Fast''' (飲食業, ''Inshokugyō'', '''Food Service Industry''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]].

==Effect==
Accounting Power UP (M): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 20%.

